{"id":"4a5a98838569525e","group":"58","path":"58/batch05/58-df-extreme-point.md","title":"Extreme Point","display":"df-extreme-point — Extreme Point","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-extreme-point","aliases":["58-df-extreme-point","Extreme Point"],"display":"df-extreme-point — Extreme Point","depends_on":["[[../batch08/58-df-convex-set.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-extreme-point"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-extreme-point</span><span>Extreme Point</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-extreme-point — Extreme Point"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"341b5a5ae2ec5b04\" href=\"?note=341b5a5ae2ec5b04\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-convex-set.md\">../batch08/58-df-convex-set.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x,C,W,+,\\odot\\in V\">\\(x,C,W,+,\\odot\\in V\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ConvexStructure}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ConvexStructure}_S\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"341b5a5ae2ec5b04\" href=\"?note=341b5a5ae2ec5b04\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-convex-set.md\">../batch08/58-df-convex-set.md</a> 的四元结构式凸性谓词。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ExtremePointStructure}_{58}\\subseteq V^5\">\\(\\mathrm{ExtremePointStructure}_{58}\\subseteq V^5\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ExtremePoint}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{ExtremePoint}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> 由下式定义。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{ExtremePointStructure}_{58}(x,C,W,+,\\odot)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{ConvexStructure}_S(C,W,+,\\odot)\\land x\\in C\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall y,z\\in C\\;\\forall\\lambda\\in(0,1)\\;\n\\Bigl(x=+(\\langle\\odot(\\langle\\lambda,y\\rangle),\\odot(\\langle1-\\lambda,z\\rangle)\\rangle)\n\\to y=x\\land z=x\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{ExtremePointStructure}_{58}(x,C,W,+,\\odot)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{ConvexStructure}_S(C,W,+,\\odot)\\land x\\in C\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall y,z\\in C\\;\\forall\\lambda\\in(0,1)\\;\n\\Bigl(x=+(\\langle\\odot(\\langle\\lambda,y\\rangle),\\odot(\\langle1-\\lambda,z\\rangle)\\rangle)\n\\to y=x\\land z=x\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}extreme\\text{-}point}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ExtremePoint}_S(x,C,W)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists +,\\odot\\in V\\;\\mathrm{ExtremePointStructure}_{58}(x,C,W,+,\\odot).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}extreme\\text{-}point}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ExtremePoint}_S(x,C,W)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists +,\\odot\\in V\\;\\mathrm{ExtremePointStructure}_{58}(x,C,W,+,\\odot).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>原三元谓词仍采用存在兼容向量空间结构的约定；同一次调用中的凸性与极端性现在使用同一组加法和数乘。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Rockafellar, Convex Analysis</li>\n<li>Phelps, Convex Functions, Monotone Operators and Differentiability</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch08/58-df-convex-set.md","status":"resolved","id":"341b5a5ae2ec5b04","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch08/58-df-convex-set.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch08/58-df-convex-set.md","status":"resolved","id":"341b5a5ae2ec5b04","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ConvexStructure}_S$ 使用 [[../batch08/58-df-convex-set.md]] 的四元结构式凸性谓词。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"x,C,W,+,\\odot\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ConvexStructure}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ExtremePointStructure}_{58}\\subseteq V^5","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ExtremePoint}_S\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{ExtremePointStructure}_{58}(x,C,W,+,\\odot)\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathrm{ConvexStructure}_S(C,W,+,\\odot)\\land x\\in C\\\\\n&\\land\\forall y,z\\in C\\;\\forall\\lambda\\in(0,1)\\;\n\\Bigl(x=+(\\langle\\odot(\\langle\\lambda,y\\rangle),\\odot(\\langle1-\\lambda,z\\rangle)\\rangle)\n\\to y=x\\land z=x\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}extreme\\text{-}point}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ExtremePoint}_S(x,C,W)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists +,\\odot\\in V\\;\\mathrm{ExtremePointStructure}_{58}(x,C,W,+,\\odot).","display":true}],"bytes":1332,"backlinks":[{"id":"a11585cba9c21cfd","anchor":"ref-257","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[58-df-extreme-point]]"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-512","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch05/58-df-extreme-point.md|58-df-extreme-point]]（batch05）"}],"outgoing":["341b5a5ae2ec5b04"]}